- `evaluateBoardState` pulls in `evaluateSequences`, `evaluatePotentialCaptures`, `countPairOpenness`, `evaluateVulnerablePairs`, etc. — your **static evaluation** at leaves / timeouts.
- `placeStone` (from `Rules` / `GameState`) — applies the real game rules.
- `countCapturesIfPlaced`, `isTacticalHotSpot` — used in generation / reductions.

